{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37269","headline":"隋堤 · 秦韬玉","name":"隋堤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"种柳开河爲胜游，堤前常使路人愁。\n阴埋野色万条思，翠束寒声千里秋。\n西日至今悲兔苑，东[波]终不反龙舟。\n远山应见繁华事，不语青青对水流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦韬玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}